      <name>Strawberry Brix 7-8</name>
      <category>Fruit</category>
      <info>A strawberry purée with a BRIX value of between 7-8.
Confidence: high
Strawberry purée with Brix 7-8 is mostly water with 7-8% soluble solids, primarily natural sugars and some fiber. Typical strawberry composition used: ~0.6g protein, ~0.2g fat, ~8g carbs (of which ~6g are sugars, ~1.5g fiber), and trace minerals. No added sugars or sugar alcohols. Sugars breakdown based on USDA data for strawberries. Ash, vitamins, and minerals estimated from standard strawberry purée values. No dairy or cocoa content.</info>
