      <name>Balsamic Vinegar</name>
      <category>Fruit</category>
      <info>Confidence: high
Balsamic vinegar is made from grape must and wine vinegar, typically contains 15–17g carbs/100g, mostly as sugars (glucose, fructose). Protein and fat are negligible. Ash, sodium, and minerals are low but present. No added sugars, alcohol, or fiber. Values based on USDA and EU food composition tables for balsamic vinegar.</info>
